extends baseEmail

block content
  p Hi, #{firstName}
  p You requested a password reset for your Natours account 🔒

  p Please click the button below to create a new password. This link is valid only for a short time, so make sure to reset your password as soon as possible.

  table.btn.btn-primary(role='presentation', border='0', cellpadding='0', cellspacing='0')
    tbody
      tr
        td(align='left')
          table(role='presentation', border='0', cellpadding='0', cellspacing='0')
            tbody
              tr
                td
                  a(href=`${url}`, target='_blank') Reset your password

  p If you didn’t request this password change, you can safely ignore this email and your password will remain the same.

  p Stay safe and happy exploring! 🌍
  p - Rahul Bisht, CEO
